#. module: takeaway_restaurant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:takeaway_restaurant.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Yes! We offer clear labels for Vegetarian, Vegan, Gluten-Free, and Nut-Free "
"options directly on our online menu."
msgstr ""
"ແມ່ນແລ້ວ! ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຕິດປ້າຍບອກຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງສຳລັບເມນູ ມັງສະວິຣັດ (Vegetarian), ວີແກນ (Vegan), "
"ປາສະຈາກກູເຕັນ (Gluten-Free), ແລະ ປາສະຈາກຖົ່ວ (Nut-Free) ຢູ່ເທິງເມນູອອນລາຍໂດຍກົງ."

#. module: takeaway_restaurant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:takeaway_restaurant.view_page_home
msgid ""
"You can genuinely taste how fresh the ingredients are. The salmon was cooked "
"to perfection and the veggies were crisp and full of flavor. It doesn't feel "
"like 'takeout' food at all, it feels like fine dining in my living room."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດສຳຜັດໄດ້ເຖິງຄວາມສົດຂອງວັດຖຸດິບແທ້ໆ. ປາແຊວມອນປຸງແຕ່ງໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນແບບ ແລະ "
"ຜັກກໍກອບພ້ອມລົດຊາດທີ່ເຕັມປ່ຽມ. ບໍ່ຮູ້ສຶກຄືກັບອາຫານ 'ສັ່ງມາກິນຢູ່ບ້ານ' ເລີຍ, "
"ໃຫ້ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກຄືກັບກິນອາຫານລະດັບ Fine Dining ຢູ່ຫ້ອງຮັບແຂກຂອງຕົນເອງ."

#. module: takeaway_restaurant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:takeaway_restaurant.welcome_article_body
msgid "You can still do it by upgrading your package in Apps."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດຂອງທ່ານໃນເມນູ ແອັບ (Apps)."

#. module: takeaway_restaurant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:takeaway_restaurant.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can then get an overview of your bookings, including preferences, "
"allergies, and more with appointment questions."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງພາບລວມຂອງການຈອງ, ລວມທັງຄວາມມັກສ່ວນຕົວ, ອາການແພ້ອາຫານ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ "
"ຜ່ານຄຳຖາມໃນການນັດໝາຍ."

#. module: takeaway_restaurant
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:takeaway_restaurant.welcome_article_body
